          "documentation": {
            "text": "The least by which one cycle's evaluation time follows another's: a microsecond.\n\n`earliest_start` is this much after `never`, and `latest_end` this much\nbefore `forever`.\n\nExamples:\n    ~~~hgl\n    assert smallest_step == 1us\n    assert earliest_start - never == smallest_step\n    ~~~\n\nRules:\n    CRUN-3",
